{"id":189213,"name":"B18-F1,2P G-Cribs","headline":"Refreshed & Uplifted 2 BDR @ G Cribs","summary":"","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis cozy 2 bedroom apartment is located in G-cribs with free pool access.\r\n\r\nThe 2 bedroom apartment comes with an open plan fully equipped kitchen, 2 full bathrooms  and a living room , not to mention a beautiful balcony  that enjoy views of the pool.\r\n\r\nIt also features a 65 inch smart TV with Airplay and cable channels, washing machine, a Nespresso machine, kettle and a microwave. The apartment is great for couples & families. \r\n\r\nThe styling is made with a modish and calming taste to ensure guests have a wonderful and relaxing experience. \r\n\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire apartment\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nWe are more than happy to answer all of your questions.  Guests can text and call anytime they need help and our team will be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\nG Cribs is the comfort zone for those who want to discover more.\r\nEach unit receives full access to all facilities and services G Cribs provides.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nFree outdoor parking is available. \r\nTuktuks are available to take you anywhere in El Gouna.\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note that smoking is not allowed inside the apartment. A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n Egyptian and Arab couples are required to provide marriage certificate, according to the Egyptian law. Foreign nationalities do not need a marriage certificate.\r\n"},"city":"El Gouna","capacity_of_guests":4,"number_of_bedrooms":2,"number_of_beds":4,"number_of_bathrooms":2,"number_of_stars":5,"location_address1":"G Cribs","location_address2":"","location_lat":"27.394131","location_lng":"33.642338","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"apartment","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":25,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":383059,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"• Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 150 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \r\n • Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests stated in the reservation will be granted entry. \r\n• Egyptian & Arab couples ONLY are required to provide proof of marriage according to Egyptian law. Guests are required to send their IDs or passports to the email (id@xurustays.com) or (id.elgouna@xurustays.com) as per the local regulations.\r\n• El Gouna entry permits require 48 hours to be issued, in case guest IDs and passports are sent less than 48 hours before check in date, entry permits are subject to delay or may not be granted. (In case of disapproval from community security office, guests will be fully refunded).\r\n • Cancellation more than 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 10% of the total price of the stay.\r\n • Cancellation between 15 days and 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 50% of the total price of the stay. \r\n• Cancellation between 7 days and 15 days before the arrival date, we keep 75% of the total price of the stay.\r\n• Less than 7 days, we keep 100% of the price of the stay\r\n• Pets are not allowed, in case of violation, Xuru Stays has the right to cancel the reservation with no refund. \r\