lean, it was very modern as described and the host was very helpful.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5231072,"review":"Super clean and extremely convenient in every single detail… Host is beyond amazing… Thanks for the great stay!","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5250516,"review":"A great experience","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5263225,"review":"Very nice and clean place. It has all you need for a couple days anywhere.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5263903,"review":"Het appartement was heel erg fijn en schoon.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5287634,"review":"Lovely stay!","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5289135,"review":"Very nice place to spend the night in and find more activities to explore in Gouna elsewhere.\nClean house to use for sleeping","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5290183,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5307519,"review":"The place was too clean and everything you would need while your stay is available , even when I faced issue with the WIFi they fixed it immediately.\nIt was a great to stay there.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5340801,"review":"Clean and well equipped place","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5371843,"review":"Better than expected. 15-20 mins drive to all important places in Gouna.\nRecommend!!","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5414546,"review":"Super amazing place. Very professional team. Peacful stay without any problems.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5431651,"review":"Great private space in El Gouna. Communicative host.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5447481,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5463505,"review":"Positive:\nVery great hospitality, very clean facilities and there is a heated pool in the compound.\n\nNegative:\nNothing","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z"},{"id":5478187,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5481525,"review":"We had a horrible check in experience, we arrived at night  and couldn't get in, because the host gave us a wrong  code from the lockbox. The host replyed only at 10 in the morning. We were lucky to hit a right code combination after standing nearly 2 hours behind the locked door. In the apartment one door handle was visibly broken, water didn't go well in one of the bathrooms, one kitchen chair completely broken and stains from some food on the wall near the waste bin. We complained on the door handle and the bathroom sink and they were promptly fixed. Apart from that, the apartment was good, plus no wind on the balcony.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5486875,"review":"great hosting","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5539727,"review":"I had a wonderful stay with Xuru Stays at G Cribs! The apartment was exactly as described—modern, clean, and fully equipped with everything I needed for a comfortable and relaxing getaway. The check-in process was smooth, and the host was very responsive and helpful throughout my stay.\n\nThe location is perfect—peaceful. I especially appreciated the quiet atmosphere and the access to the pool, which was always clean and not crowded.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a cozy, stylish, and hassle-free stay in El Gouna. I’ll definitely be coming back!","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5590247,"review":"The airbnb itself was very clean and cozy however the water heater literally started spilling water from the first night which flooded and steamed one of the bathrooms fully. when a maintenance team was sent they spent 4 hours at the airbnb replacing the heater only for the new one to also drip. we eventually had to completely shut it off therefore we didn’t have access to hot water.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5657939,"review":"perfect stay","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:16.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:16.000000Z"},{"id":5657959,"review":"شكرا","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:16.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:16.000000Z"},{"id":5716691,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5729937,"review":"Positive:\nالشقه نظيفه\n\nNegative:\nالموقع بعيد عن الخدمات وصعوبة الوصول اليه","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5730741,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nPiscine très sale vert, cassé dans la piscine très mal, entretenu, parasol cassé","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5733146,"review":"“I had a wonderful stay! The owner was incredibly responsive, always quick to reply, and very helpful throughout my visit. An amazing host who truly made my experience comfortable and enjoyable. \nHighly recommend!”","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5750408,"review":"Excellent ","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5752007,"review":"Positive:\nThe apartment was lovely - clean and well-located near the pools. The decor was tasteful and modern and the kitchen was well equipped with good quality appliances.\n\nParking was easy and convenient.\nI am disabled and use a walking stick, so it was a relief to have lift access.\n\nXuru Stays staff were very responsive and helpful. When we accidentally locked ourselves out, it only took about 30 minutes for the problem to be resolved.\n\nNegative:\nThere wasn't really anything to dislike about the apartment. \n\nWe did report the condition of the umbrellas by the pool, which were no longer safe or fit for purpose. Efforts were made to remove them, but we weren't there long enough to see any further follow-up.\n\nThe location was really peaceful but quite a long way out from the Marina and Downtown areas. I would say a car is essential.\n\nCurrently, the access road surfaces to the area reflect the ongoing building works nearby; it's quite hard on vehicles unless you're driving an SUV.","rental_id":189213,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5837570,"review":"Xuru team are very supportive but the place was far from every thing without any s